1
00:00:51,940 --> 00:00:52,880
Tell me,

2
00:00:54,240 --> 00:00:55,580
could it be that

3
00:00:56,060 --> 00:00:57,660
my dad is now

4
00:00:58,580 --> 00:01:00,400
with these stars too,

5
00:01:04,340 --> 00:01:06,100
in the distant galaxy,

6
00:01:06,860 --> 00:01:07,740
watching me?

7
00:01:18,080 --> 00:01:19,140
Maybe.

8
00:01:30,800 --> 00:01:31,600
Hey,

9
00:01:36,039 --> 00:01:37,000
are you okay?

10
00:01:42,780 --> 00:01:44,800
Why are you crying all of a sudden?

11
00:01:47,280 --> 00:01:49,610
Alright, stop crying. We're almost home.

12
00:01:53,800 --> 00:01:54,729
I feel terrible.

13
00:01:59,600 --> 00:02:00,400
You.

14
00:02:24,400 --> 00:02:26,740
Please help take off her shoes.

15
00:02:33,140 --> 00:02:35,600
Why don't you take care of your own daughter?

16
00:02:35,880 --> 00:02:37,680
I can't get out of here.

17
00:02:37,800 --> 00:02:38,740
Please help take care of her.

18
00:02:38,740 --> 00:02:39,940
Are you crazy?

19
00:02:39,940 --> 00:02:41,340
Who are you talking to?

20
00:02:42,740 --> 00:02:43,340
Thank you.

21
00:02:43,340 --> 00:02:44,540
Thank you, thank you.

22
00:02:48,020 --> 00:02:49,579
Don't touch me.

23
00:02:53,900 --> 00:02:55,980
It's okay.

24
00:02:57,340 --> 00:02:58,880
This is outrageous.

25
00:02:59,140 --> 00:03:00,780
I want some water.

26
00:03:02,080 --> 00:03:03,880
Please help get a glass of water.

27
00:03:04,400 --> 00:03:06,200
Get it yourself if you want some.

28
00:03:07,240 --> 00:03:08,880
Why are you yelling at her?

29
00:03:08,880 --> 00:03:10,180
She had too much to drink.

30
00:03:10,180 --> 00:03:11,880
Just help get a glass of water.

31
00:03:11,880 --> 00:03:13,780
Thank you.

32
00:03:14,800 --> 00:03:16,340
Fine, this is the last time.

33
00:03:27,460 --> 00:03:29,180
Please feed him.

34
00:03:29,380 --> 00:03:30,380
Are you done?

35
00:03:30,380 --> 00:03:32,140
Please help me.

36
00:03:43,079 --> 00:03:44,079
Drink some water.

37
00:03:54,140 --> 00:03:55,740
I haven't removed my makeup.

38
00:03:57,740 --> 00:03:59,200
Help me remove my makeup.

39
00:03:59,680 --> 00:04:01,440
Could you do me another favor?

40
00:04:04,900 --> 00:04:06,200
Go to sleep.

41
00:04:07,780 --> 00:04:10,040
I haven't removed my makeup yet.

42
00:04:30,400 --> 00:04:31,200
Wait for me here.

43
00:04:31,200 --> 00:04:32,060
Okay, Mr. Ling.

44
00:04:39,540 --> 00:04:40,680
My Yangyang is back.

45
00:04:42,640 --> 00:04:43,360
Father,

46
00:04:44,060 --> 00:04:45,020
I'm back.

47
00:04:46,980 --> 00:04:47,780
Come with me.

48
00:04:51,200 --> 00:04:52,780
This is unreasonable.

49
00:04:52,940 --> 00:04:54,140
Outrageous.

50
00:04:56,280 --> 00:04:58,040
So disgusting.

51
00:05:01,440 --> 00:05:04,140
I can't believe I ended up like this.

52
00:05:17,620 --> 00:05:18,260
Father.

53
00:05:19,440 --> 00:05:21,640
Today's premiere was very successful.

54
00:05:24,140 --> 00:05:25,220
I've put you in the company

55
00:05:25,220 --> 00:05:27,480
and invested so many resources and cash.

56
00:05:27,580 --> 00:05:29,280
If you still can't do it right,

57
00:05:29,800 --> 00:05:31,800
there's no need to come see me again.

58
00:05:32,680 --> 00:05:33,460
Yes.

59
00:05:35,800 --> 00:05:38,200
How did you handle that little influencer?

60
00:05:38,540 --> 00:05:39,800
It's all taken care of.

61
00:05:40,280 --> 00:05:41,680
Such a small matter

62
00:05:42,200 --> 00:05:44,460
caused so much negative public opinion.

63
00:05:45,140 --> 00:05:47,840
You can't even control a minor artist.

64
00:05:48,740 --> 00:05:50,360
You're in the company every day.

65
00:05:50,360 --> 00:05:51,620
What exactly do you do?

66
00:05:51,980 --> 00:05:53,780
Father, I assure you

67
00:05:54,140 --> 00:05:55,200
she will no longer have

68
00:05:55,200 --> 00:05:56,659
any impact on our company.

69
00:06:01,780 --> 00:06:03,820
You must maintain that group well.

70
00:06:05,080 --> 00:06:06,560
It is directly related to

71
00:06:07,220 --> 00:06:09,750
the commercial interests behind our family,

72
00:06:11,180 --> 00:06:14,040
which is the meaning of Shengli Media's existence.

73
00:06:15,980 --> 00:06:17,240
I understand, Father.

74
00:06:17,340 --> 00:06:18,800
I promise I will do it well.

75
00:06:24,740 --> 00:06:25,540
Wait.

76
00:06:28,780 --> 00:06:29,940
From now on,

77
00:06:30,920 --> 00:06:33,080
let me know in advance if you come home.

78
00:06:35,180 --> 00:06:36,440
Ling Yang has grown up.

79
00:06:37,080 --> 00:06:39,610
I don't want him to have much contact with you.

80
00:06:44,440 --> 00:06:45,640
Understood, Father.

81
00:06:51,480 --> 00:06:53,060
Did you have fun today?

82
00:06:55,240 --> 00:06:56,020
Brother.

83
00:06:57,640 --> 00:06:58,600
Brother, why are you here?

84
00:06:58,600 --> 00:07:00,400
Are you staying at home tonight?

85
00:07:09,400 --> 00:07:10,380
Brother.

86
00:07:14,220 --> 00:07:15,020
Let's go.

87
00:07:28,980 --> 00:07:30,940
I will give you what you deserve.

88
00:07:33,580 --> 00:07:35,580
I've been with you for so many years.

89
00:07:35,600 --> 00:07:38,000
Now that you have money, you want to dump me?

90
00:07:38,040 --> 00:07:39,140
Enough.

91
00:07:39,560 --> 00:07:41,159
I won't give you a penny less.

92
00:07:41,940 --> 00:07:42,600
Just leave.

93
00:07:43,220 --> 00:07:44,400
You bastard.

94
00:07:45,280 --> 00:07:47,080
Is it because of that bitch?

95
00:07:47,400 --> 00:07:49,200
Say something, Ling Hengsheng.

96
00:07:50,580 --> 00:07:51,140
Say something!

97
00:07:51,140 --> 00:07:51,940
Take her away.

98
00:07:52,680 --> 00:07:54,760
Ling Hengsheng, you bastards!

99
00:07:55,220 --> 00:07:56,080
Let me go!

100
00:08:29,440 --> 00:08:30,970
From today on, you move out.

101
00:08:31,140 --> 00:08:32,669
I've arranged everything.

102
00:08:42,679 --> 00:08:44,039
Don't be unhappy.

103
00:08:44,039 --> 00:08:46,080
I'll keep you company tonight.

104
00:08:46,360 --> 00:08:47,580
Okay?

105
00:08:49,780 --> 00:08:50,840
What are you doing?

106
00:08:51,560 --> 00:08:53,880
You're always like this when you come back from home.

107
00:08:53,880 --> 00:08:55,210
Since you're not happy,

108
00:08:55,240 --> 00:08:56,540
don't go back anymore.

109
00:08:57,000 --> 00:08:59,640
I see your dad never treats you well.

110
00:09:00,240 --> 00:09:00,820
He

111
00:09:01,060 --> 00:09:02,860
never treated you as his own son.

112
00:09:03,380 --> 00:09:05,580
Don't fight with your brother anymore.

113
00:09:05,840 --> 00:09:08,100
We can live well on our own.

114
00:09:08,400 --> 00:09:09,200
Right?

115
00:09:11,580 --> 00:09:12,510
What did you say?

116
00:09:15,000 --> 00:09:16,040
Let me go!

117
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:23,040
Let me tell you,

118
00:09:23,340 --> 00:09:25,060
I am his biological son.

119
00:09:25,880 --> 00:09:28,380
If you didn't look somewhat like that woman,

120
00:09:28,780 --> 00:09:31,440
did you really think you were good enough for me?

121
00:09:44,740 --> 00:09:45,670
Someone hit you?

122
00:09:46,440 --> 00:09:47,240
Yes.

123
00:09:49,000 --> 00:09:51,000
My people wouldn't lay a hand on you.

124
00:09:51,800 --> 00:09:53,200
Maybe it was a fan.

125
00:09:55,280 --> 00:09:56,080
Also,

126
00:09:57,380 --> 00:09:59,510
how could you get physical in the room?

127
00:10:00,340 --> 00:10:02,200
Just as things were calming down,

128
00:10:02,200 --> 00:10:03,180
you messed up again.

129
00:10:03,180 --> 00:10:04,710
Don't talk to me about this.

130
00:10:05,200 --> 00:10:07,330
Call that Mu Cheng over here right now.

131
00:10:07,740 --> 00:10:09,740
I've never been bullied in my life.

132
00:10:11,080 --> 00:10:12,340
Mu Cheng has a live stream...

133
00:10:12,340 --> 00:10:12,720
Right now,

134
00:10:12,720 --> 00:10:14,250
you must call her over here.

135
00:10:20,540 --> 00:10:21,760
Hello, Mr. Ling.

136
00:10:22,080 --> 00:10:23,180
I'm at the hospital now.

137
00:10:23,180 --> 00:10:24,800
The girl is quite seriously injured.

138
00:10:24,800 --> 00:10:25,980
Handle it yourself.

139
00:10:26,240 --> 00:10:28,000
Give her however much money she wants.

140
00:10:28,000 --> 00:10:29,640
Just don't let her bother me again.

141
00:10:29,640 --> 00:10:30,040
Mr. Ling.

142
00:10:30,040 --> 00:10:30,580
Ling Ze.

143
00:10:30,780 --> 00:10:31,680
The girl is unwilling to settle right now.

144
00:10:31,680 --> 00:10:32,420
Tell her to come here right now.

145
00:10:32,420 --> 00:10:32,960
She says...

146
00:10:32,960 --> 00:10:33,560
I must have a word with her today.

147
00:10:33,560 --> 00:10:35,160
she wants to sue you in court.

148
00:10:35,380 --> 00:10:36,180
Wait a moment.

149
00:10:37,000 --> 00:10:37,460
Mr. Ling.

150
00:10:37,460 --> 00:10:38,060
I can't wait.

151
00:10:38,060 --> 00:10:39,340
I'm afraid you'll have to handle this personally.

152
00:10:39,340 --> 00:10:40,180
How much money have I spent on this bitch?

153
00:10:40,180 --> 00:10:40,580
Or...

154
00:10:40,980 --> 00:10:41,980
How is she treating me now?

155
00:10:41,980 --> 00:10:43,310
You go talk to this girl.

156
00:10:43,940 --> 00:10:45,740
The girl is quite emotional right now,

157
00:10:45,740 --> 00:10:47,340
so she probably won't agree to a settlement easily.

158
00:10:47,340 --> 00:10:48,100
I got it.

159
00:10:50,840 --> 00:10:51,420
I'm just afraid...

160
00:10:51,420 --> 00:10:53,280
Call Mu Cheng over here right now.

161
00:10:54,140 --> 00:10:54,670
Mr. Ling.

162
00:10:55,220 --> 00:10:56,160
Call Mu Cheng over here right now.

163
00:10:56,160 --> 00:10:57,290
I said wait a moment.

164
00:11:02,140 --> 00:11:03,800
No matter what method you use,

165
00:11:03,940 --> 00:11:05,540
suppress this matter for me.
